1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:03,130
(Bernadette:)Yeah. Or you'd be
the oldest one here.

2
00:00:05,625 --> 00:00:08,105
(Penny:)Really? Is that how you
talk to your mother?

3
00:00:12,932 --> 00:00:14,432
(Howard:)He just parked.
He's on his way up.

4
00:00:14,601 --> 00:00:15,811
(Leonard:)Good. This is exciting.

5
00:00:15,969 --> 00:00:17,209
(Raj:)It is. I feel alive.

6
00:00:17,370 --> 00:00:19,540
What if we do get caught?
Who cares?

7
00:00:19,706 --> 00:00:21,116
(Leonard:)So we get banned from Comic-Con.

8
00:00:21,274 --> 00:00:22,614
(Raj:)Maybe slapped with a fine.

9
00:00:22,776 --> 00:00:24,886
I'll be an astronaut and a bad boy.

10
00:00:25,044 --> 00:00:27,084
(Howard:)How will women keep their pants on?

11
00:00:28,481 --> 00:00:30,981
(Raj:)Maybe it'll come up when
I apply for citizenship.

12
00:00:32,552 --> 00:00:35,052
(Raj:)Oh, crap, what if it comes up
when I apply for citizenship?

13
00:00:35,989 --> 00:00:37,769
(Leonard:)I wonder if we'd have
to disclose something like this

14
00:00:37,924 --> 00:00:39,564
(Leonard:)when we apply for grants.

15
00:00:40,493 --> 00:00:42,093
(Raj:)He's gonna be here any second,
what should we do?

16
00:00:42,262 --> 00:00:44,002
(Howard:)You guys are such babies.

17
00:00:44,164 --> 00:00:45,644
(Howard:)I'll handle this.

18
00:00:47,167 --> 00:00:49,117
(Howard:)If he thinks we're not home,
he'll go away.

19
00:00:51,838 --> 00:00:52,838
(Raj:)I thought you were a badass.

20
00:00:53,006 --> 00:01:02,026
(Howard:)I lied about the Pepto,
I always use the little cup!

